deId":3890601,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":1108642579,"text":"Oh, we can't advance any further. The ruins seem to be guarded by ancient <color=#00E1FFFF>seals</color>.","nextNodeIds":[3890602]},{"nodeId":3890602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":41225995,"text":"Is this the work of Dvalin?","nextNodeIds":[3890603]},{"nodeId":3890603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":3659726611,"text":"No. These ruins were once part of an ancient city. Dvalin just happens to be nesting in these ruins for now.","nextNodeIds":[3890604]},{"nodeId":3890604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":1838829363,"text":"These ruins even predate the existence of The Four Winds.","nextNodeIds":[3890605]},{"nodeId":3890605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":4210965211,"text":"Mondstadt is a city without a ruler. However, before it was...","nextNodeIds":[3890606]},{"nodeId":3890606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":2454763571,"text":"It was ruled over by a tyrant.","nextNodeIds":[3890607]},{"nodeId":3890607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":1328838603,"text":"Anyway... I'll sing you that story when we have a chance in the future.","nextNodeIds":[3890608]},{"nodeId":3890608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"Diluc","textMapHash":9440571,"text":"The markings on this seal... If my archaeological knowledge is not mistaken, this appears to be a <color=#00E1FFFF>light actuator</color>.","nextNodeIds":[3890609]},{"nodeId":3890609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"Diluc","textMapHash":2302334459,"text":"If we retrieve and <color=#00E1FFFF>reintegrate</color> all the <color=#00E1FFFF>parts</color>, we should be able to <color=#00E1FFFF>get it 